# Conventional Commits

Commit messages follow [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/). See `AGENTS.md` §Git commits.

```
<type>[optional scope]: <description>
```

- Types: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `perf`, `test`, `chore`
- Scopes when useful: `room`, `books`, `guestbook`, `worker`, `audio`, `window`, `mobile`
- Description: imperative, lowercase, no trailing period
- Breaking change: `BREAKING CHANGE:` footer or `type(scope)!: description`

```
# good
feat(analytics): track page views and room interactions with GA4
fix(mobile): invert stick so forward matches look direction

# bad
Add google analytics
Fixed the stick.
```
